    {
      "id": "grappling-hook",
      "name": "Grappling Hook",
      "category": "Adventuring Gear",
      "description": "As a Utilize action, you can throw the Grappling Hook at a railing, a ledge, or another catch within 50 feet of yourself, and the hook catches on if you succeed on a DC 13 Agility (Acrobatics) check. If you tied a Rope to the hook, you can then climb it.",
