      "name": "Healer's Kit",
      "category": "Adventuring Gear",
      "description": "A Healer's Kit has ten uses. As a Utilize action, you can expend one of its uses to stabilize an Unconscious creature that has 0 Hit Points without needing to make a Spirit (Medicine) check.",
      "source": "http://dnd2024.wikidot.com/equipment:adventuring-gear",
